sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Au as Author
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API as API routes
  participant SV as EvaluationService
  participant AG as Evaluator agent
  participant RT as Raters A, B, C
  participant CO as Consolidator K
  participant DB as Postgres

  Au->>UI: drop workbook + frozen scorecard
  UI->>API: POST /api/runs (multipart)
  API->>SV: submit()
  Note over SV: parse scorecard · check it is frozen · check the roster<br/>open the workbook · check the sheets it names exist
  SV->>DB: create run (queued), next iteration number
  SV-->>API: run id
  API-->>UI: 202 Accepted
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/:id every 1.5 s

  Note over SV,AG: runs in the background after the 202
  SV->>AG: evaluate()
  Note over AG: freeze: read once, SHA-256 of workbook and scorecard<br/>count: exact checks scored in code
  par three blind raters in parallel
    AG->>RT: same prompt (scorecard + artifact + sources)
    RT-->>AG: JSON: 0-5 per dimension, cited cells, findings
  end
  Note over AG: keep only claims whose cited cell really exists
  AG->>CO: three validated results + artifact
  CO-->>AG: reconciled scores, merged findings
  Note over AG: enforce the rules: range check, lower score stands, verdict by code<br/>re-hash the workbook, abort if it changed
  AG-->>SV: evaluation (scores, findings, run log)
  SV->>DB: store run, dimension scores, findings, every model call
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/:id
  API->>DB: load run + human evidence + override
  API-->>UI: report (verdict, scores, findings, path to green)
